<c.simplifiedchinese>我这样想</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:37.788 --> 00:16:39.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此…</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:42.793 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:42.876 --> 00:16:46.755 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你把刀换成了逆刃刀一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:46.839 --> 00:16:50.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我把我的螺旋剑换成了直刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:50.467 --> 00:16:54.013 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>并决定作为一名剑士
来保护埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:54.096 --> 00:16:57.099 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一个人也没关系的</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:57.182 --> 00:17:02.104 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少在到达下一个目的地美国之前
让我一起同行吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:17:02.187 --> 00:17:03.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:17:03.731 --> 00:17:04.982 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:17:05.065 --> 00:17:08.360 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨天的敌人变成了今天的朋友啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:17:08.444 --> 00:17:09.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:17:10.612 --> 00:17:14.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们接下来要离开日本了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:17:14.825 --> 00:17:16.285 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-没错
-没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:17.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上保重</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:28.922 --> 00:17:31.300 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去办理出国的手续</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:31.925 --> 00:17:34.053 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很高兴你来送我</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:39.391 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这让我感觉下次我来的时候
你还会在这里迎接我</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:39.475 --> 00:17:41.602 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不只是在下来为你送行啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:41.685 --> 00:17:42.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:43.145 --> 00:17:44.480 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:44.563 --> 00:17:45.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:45.731 --> 00:17:47.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们听男吉说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:47.941 --> 00:17:51.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从人渣泥庵手中拯救了居留地</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:51.612 --> 00:17:52.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次再来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:53.072 --> 00:17:55.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>妈妈身体好多了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:55.532 --> 00:17:56.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:56.909 --> 00:17:58.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太感谢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:58.619 --> 00:18:01.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次会有很多人欢迎你回来啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:02.122 --> 00:18:03.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢大家！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:04.041 --> 00:18:06.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家一定要健康啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:07.461 --> 00:18:09.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她好漂亮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:11.840 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上保重</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:17.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也请继续帮助伤者和病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:17.346 --> 00:18:18.388 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:18.472 --> 00:18:22.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会努力让大家都能健康生活的</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:27.856 --> 00:18:29.817 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好大的伤疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.444 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来是旧剑伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:32.528 --> 00:18:35.280 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但又像是昨天才形成的</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:36.115 --> 00:18:41.995 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>身体和心灵的联系
比你想象的更紧密深入</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:42.579 --> 00:18:48.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不清楚你过去发生了什么
但如果那和你的伤疤有关的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:49.461 --> 00:18:54.591 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>干脆换个新的地方开始新的生活吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:55.175 --> 00:18:56.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这被称为转地疗养</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:56.802 --> 00:19:00.973 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>离开熟悉的环境进入新的环境</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:01.056 --> 00:19:03.475 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能使人放松并得到治愈</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:04.977 --> 00:19:07.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你的关心</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:07.229 --> 00:19:08.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:08.522 --> 00:19:11.275 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下过去的路是自己选择的</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:11.984 --> 00:19:14.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不能放手</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:15.028 --> 00:19:18.657 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>过去的经历和这伤疤
在下都将继续带着</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.577 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:22.619 --> 00:19:27.040 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要用这把刀尽可能保护更多的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:28.959 --> 00:19:30.502 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:30.586 --> 00:19:33.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果刀是武士的灵魂</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:33.172 --> 00:19:35.757 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么对于拿着不杀之剑的你来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:35.841 --> 00:19:39.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种生活很相称啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:14.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>故事讲完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:18.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心 这是多久以前的事了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:19.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:23.740 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是来到神谷道场前五天左右的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:21:23.824 --> 00:21:24.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-五天？
-五天？</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:21:25.033 --> 00:21:27.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么近发生的事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:21:27.619 --> 00:21:31.456 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为肯定是很久以前的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:35.377 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没说过要讲一个很古老的故事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:21:37.254 --> 00:21:39.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是我有一件事很在意</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:21:40.048 --> 00:21:40.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:21:41.008 --> 00:21:42.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>失礼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:21:46.972 --> 00:21:51.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑你说能闻到花园里瑞香花的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:21:51.226 --> 00:21:54.396 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>却尝不到红茶的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:21:54.479 --> 00:21:56.481 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:21:56.565 --> 00:22:00.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但今天你却说茶很好喝</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:22:02.612 --> 00:22:04.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:22:04.406 --> 00:22:05.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就没事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:22:08.952 --> 00:22:10.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:22:10.454 --> 00:22:12.956 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我作为医生的建议</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:22:13.707 --> 00:22:18.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何的伤病都需要治疗和静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:22:19.046 --> 00:22:24.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>安顿在一个地方
让身心都得到休息非常重要</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:22:25.177 --> 00:22:30.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果今后遇到了叫你停下来的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:22:30.098 --> 00:22:33.977 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请尝试为他们停下脚步</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:22:36.938 --> 00:22:37.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:22:39.107 --> 00:22:41.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会记在心里的</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:22:44.946 --> 00:22:48.033 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《苏醒之狼》</c.simplifiedchinese>

